      "title": "Ser Industries Limited Announces Resignation of Directors, Effective from 5 January 2026",
      "body": "SER Industries Limited announced the following changes in the composition of the Board of Directors of the Company: Mr. Narendra Goel (DIN: 00327187) has tendered his resignation from the position of Whole-time director of the Company, with effect from the close of business hours on 5th January 2026, due to personal preoccupations, he is unable to continue serving on the Board. Mr. Arvind Khot (DIN: 06732061) has tendered his resignation from the position of Director of the Company, with effect from the close of business hours on 5th January 2026, due to personal preoccupations, he is unable to continue serving on the Board.",
